WEBVTT

00:01:58.704 --> 00:02:00.329
se aap javaab dena chaahate hain

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:02.829
Vo suraag ke lie
dekhenge aur sunenge

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:04.746
uchit pratikriya ke lie

00:02:04.746 --> 00:02:07.204
Kya aap chaahate hain
ke ise manaaya jae?

00:02:07.204 --> 00:02:08.329
Main traans hoon!

00:02:08.329 --> 00:02:11.538
Ya kya aap ise kahana chaahate
hain aur aage badhana hain

00:02:11.538 --> 00:02:13.204
Vaise main traans hoon..

00:02:13.204 --> 00:02:15.413
Ek sahee tareeka nahin hai

00:02:15.413 --> 00:02:17.871
Jo sabase mahatvapoorn 
hai jo appake lie sahee hai

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:18.996
Ek aur baat

00:02:18.996 --> 00:02:20.371
Ham yeh niyantrit nahin

00:02:20.371 --> 00:02:22.496
karte hain kaise
pratikriya deta hai

00:02:22.496 --> 00:02:24.579
lekin ham niyantrit karte
hain ki vo

00:02:24.579 --> 00:02:26.538
hamaare saath hamaare
rishte ko

00:02:26.538 --> 00:02:28.121
kaise samjhate hain

00:02:28.121 --> 00:02:30.163
ham jaanate hain ki
hamen kya kahana hai